       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. USAGETEST.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-DISPLAY-VAL PIC 9(5).
       01 WS-COMP-VAL PIC 9(5) USAGE COMP.
       01 WS-COMP3-VAL PIC 9(5) USAGE COMP-3.
       01 WS-COMP4-VAL PIC 9(5) USAGE COMP-4.
       01 WS-BINARY-VAL PIC S9(9) USAGE BINARY.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE 12345 TO WS-DISPLAY-VAL.
           MOVE 12345 TO WS-COMP-VAL.
           MOVE 12345 TO WS-COMP3-VAL.
           MOVE 12345 TO WS-COMP4-VAL.
           MOVE -12345 TO WS-BINARY-VAL.

           DISPLAY WS-DISPLAY-VAL.
           DISPLAY WS-COMP-VAL.
           DISPLAY WS-COMP3-VAL.
           DISPLAY WS-COMP4-VAL.
           DISPLAY WS-BINARY-VAL.
           STOP RUN.
